なぜですか？

03:06.450 --> 03:09.210
"不死鳥は光に逆らう

03:09.790 --> 03:12.390
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

03:11.910 --> 03:12.870
やっぱりね。

03:13.040 --> 03:16.020
♪ As years pass, dust stirs, ♪ Nstirring deep longing ♪

